#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'HELP'
OpenBao is an open source, community-driven fork of HashiCorp Vault: a tool for
managing secrets, encryption keys and identity. This plugin installs the `bao`
CLI (and server) from the official prebuilt OpenBao release binaries.

Release builds are published for Linux, macOS, FreeBSD, NetBSD, OpenBSD and
Windows, with HSM-enabled builds available for Linux on amd64/arm64.
HELP
